Cell["\<\
An exact vertical edge is incompatible with a vertex-count cap that permits \
singleton fibers. The call remains unevaluated even if some size draws could \
support that edge.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"ae22ab2a-6307-481e-bb44-a9a18af8c70a"],

